So cell-free DNA can be measured at different times in the level of cell-free DNA.

00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:40,840
It is not to then correspond to the level of, you know, cancer.

00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:51,840
So if that level goes up, then the ideas that the cancer is getting worse if that level goes down and the cancer is getting better, you're recovering.

