So I tell you even with doing a CT scan or an MRI or using tuber marker tests, you know, sometimes when you're actually getting better in your cancer's dying, the tuber marker test could spike giving you a false positive that you think you're getting worse.

00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:03,840
